<workout_file>
  <author>The Workout Generator</author>
  <name>The Long Road V</name>
  <description>A progressive build from 60% to 72% in 120 minutes. Think of this as active recovery that builds your base. This develops the cardiovascular base that powers everything else. Your breathing should barely change from sitting on the couch.</description>
